# The Cloudflare edition's Host image builds with this repository's root as its context
# (cloudflare/container/Dockerfile). It needs the shared Host code and this edition's own files, nothing else.
*
!host/src
!cloudflare/src
!cloudflare/bin
!cloudflare/overlay
!cloudflare/template
!cloudflare/policy
!cloudflare/container/supervisor.mjs
**/node_modules
